		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	/* tool cards */
	.ks-tools {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.65rem;
	}
